Facade(s)
=========================

## In 30 seconds

The **GlobalFacade** (from your Application) owns **UiFacade**, **CommandFacade**, **ServiceFacade**, and **BehaviorFacade**. Each facade stores components by `UniqueKey` (class = singleton, extra key parts = multiton). Use `getModel`, `getCommand`, `getService` — never `new` top-level components yourself.

## How to use

1. From any `FacadeReady` component, call `globalFacade()` to reach the global facade.
2. Retrieve UI: `getModel(MyModel.class)` or `getModel(MyModel.class, keyPart)`.
3. Run actions: `getCommand(MyCommand.class).run()`.
4. Async work: `returnData(MyService.class, MyService.DO_TASK, waveData...)`.
5. Behaviors: attach via the BehaviorFacade through `BehavioredComponent` APIs on Models/Commands/Services.

JRebirth provides 4+1 **Facade**s used to manage its dedicated pattern **wB-CS-Mvc**.

